        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "708090101": {
            "id": "708090101",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Are you looking for this?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7080904",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "708090301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "708090301": {
            "id": "708090301",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "(Inside the nest lie scattered scraps of paper, with what looks like broken lines of handwriting still visible on them...)",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708090302"
            ]
          },
          "708090302": {
            "id": "708090302",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Did they tear up all this paper for nesting material?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708090303"
            ]
          },
          "708090303": {
            "id": "708090303",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "There's writing on it too. Maybe we should piece it together and see what it says?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708090304"
            ]
          },
          "708090304": {
            "id": "708090304",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Guess we'll have to do it ourselves...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708090305"
            ]
          },
          "708090305": {
            "id": "708090305",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Come on, aren't you at least a little curious? What if it's a treasure map?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708090306"
            ]
          },
          "708090306": {
            "id": "708090306",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "After Paimon's repeated prodding, the scraps are finally assembled...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708090307"
            ]
          },
          "708090307": {
            "id": "708090307",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Alright, moment of truth... This is...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708090308"
            ]
          },
          "708090308": {
            "id": "708090308",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Wait... No way... Is this some kind of crime plan!?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708090310",
              "708090312"
            ]
          },
          "708090310": {
            "id": "708090310",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "H-Hey, that kind of thing happens in novels all the time! A perfectly foolproof plan that falls apart because of the one thing nobody expected...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708090313"
            ]
          },
          "708090313": {
            "id": "708090313",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Let's check the nearby tavern and see if anyone's heard rumors about someone \"planning a crime\" lately..."
          },
          "708090312": {
            "id": "708090312",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Y-Yeah! Exactly... What if someone really is plotting something? If we ignore it and something happens, it'll be too late to fix it!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7080902",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "708090201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "708090201": {
            "id": "708090201",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I found it in a bird's nest..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7080907",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "708090401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "708090401": {
            "id": "708090401",
            "speakerId": 1768,
            "speakerName": "Uchida Kotaro",
            "text": "Th-This... That's my crime plan!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708090402"
            ]
          },
          "708090402": {
            "id": "708090402",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#{NICKNAME}! He actually just admitted it!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708090403"
            ]
          },
          "708090403": {
            "id": "708090403",
            "speakerId": 1768,
            "speakerName": "Uchida Kotaro",
            "text": "No, no! Please don't misunderstand! It's just a plot idea for my next novel. I came up with it while I was drinking and wrote it down.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708090404"
            ]
          },
          "708090404": {
            "id": "708090404",
            "speakerId": 1768,
            "speakerName": "Uchida Kotaro",
            "text": "When I woke up and the page was gone, I thought it was just a drunken dream.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708090405"
            ]
          },
          "708090405": {
            "id": "708090405",
            "speakerId": 1768,
            "speakerName": "Uchida Kotaro",
            "text": "Anyway, thank you so much for helping me find it. Now my novel can finally move forward. I'll send you a signed copy when it's out!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7080906",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "708090501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "708090501": {
            "id": "708090501",
            "speakerId": 1326,
            "speakerName": "Lohen",
            "text": "Oh? Let me see. Hmm... The concept's not bad. I'd give the creativity a six out of ten. As for practicality... maybe a four.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708090502"
            ]
          },
          "708090502": {
            "id": "708090502",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "I-Is this a crime plan?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708090503"
            ]
          },
          "708090503": {
            "id": "708090503",
            "speakerId": 1326,
            "speakerName": "Lohen",
            "text": "Haha. Funny enough, I came over from the base because I heard rumors that someone around here was plotting some strange \"master plan.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708090504"
            ]
          },
          "708090504": {
            "id": "708090504",
            "speakerId": 1326,
            "speakerName": "Lohen",
            "text": "...But after reading this note, I think I understand how those rumors got started.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708090505"
            ]
          },
          "708090505": {
            "id": "708090505",
            "speakerId": 1326,
            "speakerName": "Lohen",
            "text": "I'll hand this over to the Knights just in case. And if you're free later, stop by my base. You might catch something worth watching."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7080905",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "618011501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "618011501": {
            "id": "618011501",
            "speakerId": 1768,
            "speakerName": "Uchida Kotaro",
            "text": "...Sir Knight! I swear, it's just a plot point for a novel! It wasn't a \"master plan\" for a crime or anything.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "618011502"
            ]
          },
          "618011502": {
            "id": "618011502",
            "speakerId": 1326,
            "speakerName": "Lohen",
            "text": "I understand, Mr. Uchida, I hear you loud and clear. No need to get so worked up. Why don't you have some tea and calm down first?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "618011503"
            ]
          },
          "618011503": {
            "id": "618011503",
            "speakerId": 1326,
            "speakerName": "Lohen",
            "text": "According to intel from a key informant... your manuscript really doesn't look like a \"master plan\" for a crime. After all, it would be extremely impractical to pull off.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "618011505"
            ]
          },
          "618011505": {
            "id": "618011505",
            "speakerId": 1768,
            "speakerName": "Uchida Kotaro",
            "text": "Excuse me!? What do you mean \"impractical\"!? If you're so brilliant, tell me what's wrong!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "618011506"
            ]
          },
          "618011506": {
            "id": "618011506",
            "speakerId": 1326,
            "speakerName": "Lohen",
            "text": "Too many conditions, and the steps are far too convoluted. You'd need a poison that fits your exact needs, not to mention a building that matches your specific requirements...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "618011507"
            ]
          },
          "618011507": {
            "id": "618011507",
            "speakerId": 1768,
            "speakerName": "Uchida Kotaro",
            "text": "Uhhh...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "618011508"
            ]
          },
          "618011508": {
            "id": "618011508",
            "speakerId": 1326,
            "speakerName": "Lohen",
            "text": "One tiny slip at any stage and the whole thing will be exposed instantly, won't it? Not to mention, the setup is so convoluted that it's a chore just understanding it all.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "618011509"
            ]
          },
          "618011509": {
            "id": "618011509",
            "speakerId": 1768,
            "speakerName": "Uchida Kotaro",
            "text": "...Now that you mention it, you do have a point. In that case, how should I improve this?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "618011510"
            ]
          },
          "618011510": {
            "id": "618011510",
            "speakerId": 1326,
            "speakerName": "Lohen",
            "text": "I suppose I do dabble in medicine from time to time. How about we try a bit of this... and then... a little of that?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "618011511"
            ]
          },
          "618011511": {
            "id": "618011511",
            "speakerId": 1768,
            "speakerName": "Uchida Kotaro",
            "text": "Oh! Honestly, Sir Knight, this job is beneath you! You're far too brilliant!"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}